# {{ fleet_name }}

{{ fleet_description }}

This is the Coordinator of {{ fleet_name }}, a Fleet of
[Mechs](https://monarch-initiative.github.io/mechregistry/docs/what-is-a-mech.html):
knowledge bases curated by AI agents and reviewed by people, each in its own
repository. The Coordinator holds no records. It holds the Fleet's
definition (`fleet.yaml`), the files every member shares (`canon/`), and the
checks that read the members together.

```bash
just install
just qc              # this repository
just fetch           # clone the members, read-only
just audit           # the Fleet: answers, canon pins, links between records
```

See `docs/` (built with `just docs-build`) for the members, their
relationships, the canon and the Fleet model. Made with
[mechmaker](https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mechmaker).
